Theme Direction: {argument name="theme" default="Oriental Zen Minimalist Poster"}
Style Branch: High-contrast media-friendly style
Main Content: {argument name="main subject" default="An ancient-style character standing under the eaves, slightly tilting their head to listen to wind chimes"}
Emotional Motif: Relaxed, listening, summer clarity
Scenes and Imagery: Turquoise blue eave corners, amber orange wind chime tassels, warm white walls, a few light spots, and bamboo shadows
Composition and Space: Off-center composition, character located on one side at the bottom, eave corners cutting in from the top, large bright open space left on the wall
Color Control: {argument name="color control" default="Warm white as the wall and background base, turquoise blue for eave corners and minor shadow structures, amber orange only for wind chime tassels and local light accents, character presented as a dark cyan silhouette; avoid overall blue or orange tint"}
Light and Texture: Natural daylight, clear edges, light paper texture, small amount of grain, bright and transparent
Aspect Ratio: 9:16
Supplementary Requirements: Character posture should be quiet and restrained, not too many wind chimes, the overall feel should be a refreshing New Oriental cover style

Photography Style: Cool white clear CCD lifestyle style
Portrait Direction: Urban fashion portrait
Scene Direction: {argument name="scene" default="Modern building exterior white spiral staircase / light grey shadows / minimalist linear space"}
Clothing Direction: {argument name="clothing" default="Light apricot grey off-the-shoulder slim knit top + light khaki high-waisted fitted long skirt"}
Temperament Tags: Gentle, mature, pure, restrained, feminine
Facial Features: {argument name="facial features" default="Real gentle natural face, clean and soft, non-influencer style"}

